{"id":1276,"date":"2024-12-11T22:21:52","date_gmt":"2024-12-12T03:21:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/new.biolongevitylabs.com\/?page_id=1276"},"modified":"2026-05-01T16:36:27","modified_gmt":"2026-05-01T20:36:27","slug":"about-us","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/about-us\/","title":{"rendered":"About Us"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1276\" class=\"elementor elementor-1276\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aa093dd e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"aa093dd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5bf93e3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5bf93e3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">About Us<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8485bb2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"8485bb2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-222d6f21 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"222d6f21\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-14728fa3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"14728fa3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">About BioLongevity Labs<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4bbbebfe elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4bbbebfe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>BioLongevity Labs is a U.S.-based manufacturer of research-grade peptides and bioregulators. We supply research laboratories, academic institutions, and biotech organizations with analytically verified compounds produced under strict Good Manufacturing Practices.<\/p><p>Every compound we produce is tested by three independent certified laboratories. Researchers can access full documentation with every order, including Certificates of Analysis, HPLC purity reports, and LC-MS molecular confirmation.<\/p><p>All products are intended exclusively for in vitro laboratory research.<\/p><h3>Our Mission<\/h3><p>We exist to support serious research. Our mission is to give laboratories and qualified researchers access to the highest-purity, independently verified peptides and bioregulators available \u2014 with the analytical documentation to prove it.<\/p><p>Scientific progress depends on compound reliability. We hold every batch to the same standard: 99%+ purity, independently confirmed, no exceptions.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-30993a75 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"30993a75\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-36a7fa05 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"36a7fa05\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"660\" height=\"468\" src=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Bg1-ABOUT-US.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1278\" alt=\"Lab Work\" srcset=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Bg1-ABOUT-US.jpg 660w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Bg1-ABOUT-US-300x213.jpg 300w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Bg1-ABOUT-US-600x425.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\" title=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1bae278f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1bae278f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1e6ca3d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1e6ca3d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a8100e7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"a8100e7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"1151\" src=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/pexels-mikhail-nilov-8863041-768x1151.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-image-281582\" alt=\"|\" srcset=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/pexels-mikhail-nilov-8863041-768x1151.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/pexels-mikhail-nilov-8863041-200x300.jpeg 200w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/pexels-mikhail-nilov-8863041-683x1024.jpeg 683w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/pexels-mikhail-nilov-8863041-1025x1536.jpeg 1025w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/pexels-mikhail-nilov-8863041-1366x2048.jpeg 1366w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/pexels-mikhail-nilov-8863041-600x900.jpeg 600w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/pexels-mikhail-nilov-8863041-scaled.jpeg 1708w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" title=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-736f84bc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"736f84bc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2607217e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2607217e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Quality and Manufacturing<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2f20238a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2f20238a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>BioLongevity Labs manufactures all compounds in U.S.-based GMP-certified facilities. Our production process follows strict chain of custody protocols from synthesis through packaging.<\/p><p>Every batch goes through a full analytical battery before it ships:<\/p><ul><li>HPLC for purity verification<\/li><li>LC-MS for molecular identity confirmation<\/li><li>Chemical contaminant screening<\/li><\/ul><p>Certificates of Analysis from all three independent labs are available for review before purchase at <a href=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/all-coas\/\">biolongevitylabs.com\/all-coas\/<\/a><\/p><h3>Triple Third-Party Testing<\/h3><p>BioLongevity Labs is the only research peptide supplier that independently verifies every batch through three separate certified laboratories.<\/p><p>This is not a marketing claim \u2014 it is a process. Three labs. Three independent results. One standard: 99%+ purity.<\/p><p>Researchers can access the full analytical dossier for any compound at any time on our website or by contacting help@biolongevitylabs.com.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-af6e151 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"af6e151\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-53020d6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"53020d6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0e29d55 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0e29d55\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">American Peptide Association Member<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d8c309b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d8c309b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>BioLongevity Labs is a member of the American Peptide Association (APA), the industry organization dedicated to compliance, education, and the responsible advancement of peptide research.<\/p><p>APA membership reflects our commitment to operating at the highest standards within the research peptide industry. The APA brings together manufacturers, researchers, and compliance professionals to promote best practices, regulatory awareness, and scientific accountability.<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/americanpeptide.co\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more about the American Peptide Association<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bfe458a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"bfe458a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-201f588 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"201f588\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"660\" height=\"468\" src=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/apa-logo-white.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-238697\" alt=\"American Peptide Association logo\" srcset=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/apa-logo-white.png 660w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/apa-logo-white-300x213.png 300w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/apa-logo-white-600x425.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\" title=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aac54e3 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"aac54e3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-26bb0e6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"26bb0e6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-43ffd68 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"43ffd68\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"960\" src=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/dr-ky-le-md-scaled-e1773145841254-1024x960.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-238696\" alt=\"Dr. Ky Le, MD\" srcset=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/dr-ky-le-md-scaled-e1773145841254-1024x960.webp 1024w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/dr-ky-le-md-scaled-e1773145841254-300x281.webp 300w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/dr-ky-le-md-scaled-e1773145841254-768x720.webp 768w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/dr-ky-le-md-scaled-e1773145841254-1536x1440.webp 1536w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/dr-ky-le-md-scaled-e1773145841254-600x563.webp 600w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/dr-ky-le-md-scaled-e1773145841254.webp 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" title=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c10d44c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c10d44c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-961d03c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"961d03c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Dr. Ky H. Le, MD \u2014 Scientific Reviewer<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7e46d64 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7e46d64\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Dr. Ky Le serves as our scientific reviewer, ensuring all content meets rigorous standards of scientific accuracy and research validity.<\/p><p>Dr. Le earned his medical doctorate from St. George&#8217;s University School of Medicine in 2002 and completed his family medicine residency at Memorial Hermann Southwest Hospital. He is board-certified in family medicine and currently practices in Hawaii, with affiliations at Pali Momi Medical Center and Hawaii Pacific Health Medical Group.<\/p><p>With over 20 years of clinical experience, Dr. Le brings specialized knowledge to his review of research citations, study interpretations, and scientific statements across our content library.<\/p><p><strong>Dr. Le&#8217;s review responsibilities include:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Reviewing all research citations for accuracy and relevance<\/li><li>Validating interpretations of published studies<\/li><li>Fact-checking scientific statements across published content<\/li><li>Confirming that laboratory application framing is scientifically sound<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-303fd32 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"303fd32\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-67b52c1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"67b52c1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7630c38 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7630c38\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Shipping &amp; Support<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e123b46 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e123b46\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Orders placed before 12:00 PM PT ship the same day. Free shipping applies to all orders over $400. International orders include full customs documentation and research-use declarations.<\/p><p>Our support team is available Monday through Friday, 9am to 5pm PT. Contact us at help@biolongevitylabs.com for technical questions, custom orders, or wholesale inquiries.<\/p><p><strong>Shipping at a glance:<\/strong><\/p><table width=\"624\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"208\"><p><strong>Same-Day Dispatch<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td width=\"416\"><p>Orders placed before 12:00 PM PT<\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"208\"><p><strong>Free Shipping<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td width=\"416\"><p>All orders over $400<\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"208\"><p><strong>Global Shipping<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td width=\"416\"><p>Full customs and import documentation included<\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"208\"><p><strong>Support Hours<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td width=\"416\"><p>Monday to Friday, 9am\u20135pm PT<\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2a45bb7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2a45bb7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6c20663 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6c20663\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uplo